ing to happen to all of  us next  unbelievable  unbelievable situation and uh you know  at the at the beginning the question was  would will this be days or will this be  weeks  more recently the conversation is will  this be weeks or will it be months with  some  uh analyses from foreign ministries  briefing lawmakers that this could be  years to some degree  so we will watch it every 24 hours  bringing significant news  and the refugee crisis is getting  absolutely heartbreaking to an even  greater extent than it was last week  and we're going to talk about more uh  we'll talk more about the refugee  situation on tomorrow's show in the  meantime let me know how long do you  believe the current state of affairs  will last in ukraine let me know on  twitter where you can find me at d  pacman
 

